    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Inspect the battery for corrosion or loose connections. Clean terminals with a baking soda solution and re‑tighten screws. If you need packers to shift AC from Coimbatore to Bangalore, a clean battery reduces the risk of a mid‑journey outage.</p>
