    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">One‑Quarter Tank Fuel Regulation</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Fill the tank to 25% capacity and secure the fuel cap. This balances weight distribution and keeps the engine running smoothly during transit. Most packers and movers from Bangalore to Coimbatore charges include a fuel check as part of their safety audit.</p>
